      en: ["Designed as a deep-water port to accommodate large ships", "Strategically located on the western coast of Anjouan", "Key component of the national strategic development plan", "Aims to lower shipping costs for imported goods", "Features modern container handling and storage areas", "Supported by regional and international investment funds"],
